  "body": "### New features/UI/Updates\n\n- Add import progress handling and refactor bookmark upload logic\n- Support iOS/HarmonyOS touch screen shortcut bar\n- Show footer when terminal is in fullscreen\n- UI: Improve footer UI\n- Update xterm version\n- Improve performance\n- Add Japanese README by @eltociear\n\n### Bug fixes\n\n- Fix spice session scaled mouse position\n- Fix terminal selection background color bug\n- Fix rdp profile not working issue and support RDP auth interactive (#4482)\n- Fix the electron-rebuild issue in post-install script (#4486) by @pdalexis\n\n-----\n\n### 新功能/界面/更新\n\n- 添加导入进度处理并重构书签上传逻辑\n- 支持 iOS/HarmonyOS 触摸屏幕快捷栏\n- 终端全屏时显示底部栏\n- 界面：优化底部栏界面\n- 更新 xterm 版本\n- 提升性能\n- 添加日文 README，感谢 @eltociear\n\n### Bug 修复\n\n- 修复数据初始化加载问题 (#4493)\n- 修复 spice 会话缩放鼠标位置问题\n- 修复终端选择区域背景颜色问题\n- 修复 rdp 配置不生效问题并支持 RDP 交互式认证 (#4482)\n- 修复 post-install 脚本中 electron-rebuild 路径引号问题，感谢 @pdalexis (#4486)\n\n-------\n\nDownload下载: [https://electerm.org](https://electerm.org)\n",
